WEBVTT

00:13:58.954 --> 00:14:02.079
the human being fits it
into a narrative that is palatable.

00:14:02.579 --> 00:14:03.871
The goat becomes the hero.

00:14:03.912 --> 00:14:06.162
The perpetrator becomes the victim.

00:14:06.204 --> 00:14:10.579
It was then I understood
that Abed would never apologize.

00:14:13.287 --> 00:14:15.621
Abed and I sat with our coffee.

00:14:16.704 --> 00:14:18.829
We'd spent 90 minutes together,

00:14:18.871 --> 00:14:20.496
and he was now known to me.

00:14:21.412 --> 00:14:23.579
He was not a particularly bad man

00:14:23.579 --> 00:14:25.454
or a particularly good man.

00:14:26.204 --> 00:14:28.079
He was a limited man

00:14:28.121 --> 00:14:30.579
who'd found it within himself
to be kind to me.